WEBVTT

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:32.375
kind, generous, a good writer,
a good photographer,

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:35.816
had aspirations
to work for National Geographic,

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:37.896
engaged to a beautiful lady,

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:41.560
worked as a pizza deliveryman
on Fridays and Saturdays.

00:00:42.320 --> 00:00:44.576
He was lured to a bogus address

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:45.800
by a youth gang.

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:49.120
And in a gang initiation,

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:53.440
a 14-year-old shot and killed him.

00:00:54.960 --> 00:00:58.296
The sudden, senseless death

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:02.520
of an innocent, unarmed human being;